      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹16.17 (up from ₹10.30 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹11.5b (up 21% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹546.5m (up 57% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.8% (up from 3.7% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 6% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 19% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
